{"info": {"address1": "Plot No. 77", "address2": "Jubilee Enclave Road Opposite Hitex Madhapur", "city": "Hyderabad", "zip": "500081", "country": "India", "phone": "91 40 3044 4444", "fax": "91 40 3044 4400", "website": "https://powermechprojects.com", "industry": "Engineering & Construction", "industryKey": "engineering-construction", "industryDisp": "Engineering & Construction", "sector": "Industrials", "sectorKey": "industrials", "sectorDisp": "Industrials", "longBusinessSummary": "Power Mech Projects Limited, together with its subsidiaries, provides services in power and infrastructure sectors in India and internationally. The company engages in the erection, testing, and commissioning of boilers, turbines, and generators; balance of plant (BOP), civil works and operation and maintenance (O&M); and overhauling and renovation of thermal power plants, as well as undertakes projects in the power, hydro, railway, roads and highways, irrigation, nuclear, refinery, petrochemical, oil and gas, and steel sectors. It also provides electrical transmission and distribution; industrial construction and services for power and non-power industries; and mine development operations, as well as deals in renewable energy, such as solar parks, onshore wind, battery energy storage systems, pumped storage projects, and green hydrogen and its derivatives. In addition, the company engages in the infrastructure development, and advisory and consulting business; exploring, design and engineering, developing, operating, and working on mines; recycling of wastes generated; mining sand; mining and quarrying of river bed minerals; and installation and repair of electric power and transformer plants, as well as the constructs sewage and water treatment plants. Further, it engages in the excavation of earth and rock; separation of the ore from the waste rock; stacking and handling the waste material; monitoring environmental aspects; and provision of supporting services comprising repair shops, labs, residential quarters, warehouses, and offices, as well as software development and support services. Additionally, it manufactures components for high-capacity pumps, spare parts for hydro and thermal power plant components, components for railway electrification, and facilities and processes, as well as re-blades turbines. The company was incorporated in 1999 and is based in Hyderabad, India.", "fullTimeEmployees": 9263, "companyOfficers": [{"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Sajja Kishore Babu", "age": 62, "title": "Chairman & MD", "yearBorn": 1963, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 225059095, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Rohit  Sajja", "age": 35, "title": "Executive Director of Business Development & Operations, Whole-Time Director and President", "yearBorn": 1990, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Nallamothu Nani Aravind", "title": "Chief Financial Officer", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Akhil  Kapoor", "age": 56, "title": "Senior Vice President", "yearBorn": 1969, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "N.  Balasubramanian", "age": 57, "title": "Vice President", "yearBorn": 1968, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Babu  Gogineni", "title": "Vice President", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Priyakarprabhat  Saxena", "title": "Vice President", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Murugesan  Rajendran", "age": 68, "title": "Chief Operating Officer", "yearBorn": 1957, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 2476110, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Janardan  Kar", "title": "Chief Technical Advisor of Industrial Services", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercise